# Browser harness: dependencies and the scratch copy of the pinned specs are artifacts.
node_modules/
.pinned-run/
test-results/
generation-probe-report.json
# Per-run legs of the two-leg generation comparison, 100-250 KB each. They are evidence for
# one run, not an expectation: the committed artifact is generation-comparison.json, which
# records the DIFFERENCE. Committing a leg would invite someone to treat a known divergence
# as the expected value.
gen-a.json
gen-p1.json
# Per-run legs and captures of the two-leg comparisons (startup, streaming, cancel,
# non-stream). They are 100-250 KB each and are evidence for ONE run, not an expectation: the
# committed artifacts are *-comparison.json, which record the DIFFERENCES and the checks. A
# committed leg invites someone to treat a known divergence as the expected value.
startup-gotavern-*.json
startup-pinned-*.json
stream-gotavern.json
stream-pinned.json
cancel-gotavern.json
cancel-pinned.json
nonstream-gotavern.json
nonstream-pinned.json
